IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `nii-il08-nouns`

-- ===========================================================================
-- National Insurance Law s 335 — "הוראות יסוד", who pays contributions in which branch. Row IL-08.
-- Source lines 3610-3620.
--
-- GAPS.md item 9 of row IL-07: rows IL-04 and IL-05 take the branches a person pays as an input
-- (`branches for which contributions are payable under section 335`), and the capstone supplies all
-- nine for an employee by convention. This module gives the list from the statuses s 335 turns on.
-- Each status is another Chapter's answer (insured under Chapter 5, 6, 8, 9 or 11, under s 158(1),
-- for long-term care; a housewife or widow pensioner under s 238; a controlling shareholder): inputs.
--
-- (j) "אין הוראות סעיף זה גורעות זו מזו": the subsections add up; a person pays a branch if any of them
-- imposes it. Maternity is imposed twice, by (a) on a worker who is not a resident and by (i) on one
-- insured under Chapter 11; it is one branch (row IL-04's fork F15).
--
-- THE PERIOD. The last amendment tag is תשע״ח־5 (line 3610), the fifth 5778 entry of the file's list of
-- amending Laws (line 7), by counting: the Insolvency and Economic Rehabilitation Law, 5778-2018. What
-- it changed in s 335, and when it commenced, were not checked. The row answers contribution periods
-- from January 2026, the period rows IL-04 and IL-05 answer (their assumption A1), and declines an
-- earlier year.
-- ===========================================================================

§ `Section 335 — the branches in which a person pays`

-- src:3610 | סעיף 335 – הוראות יסוד [תיקון: תשנ״ו, תשס״ג־8, תשע״ז־12, תשע״ח־5]

@ref NII s 335(a), line 3611
GIVEN p IS A `A person in a contribution period, for section 335`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 335(a) — maternity contributions, for a worker who is not an Israeli resident:` p MEANS
    p's `an employee or a self-employed person` AND NOT p's `an Israeli resident`
-- src:3611 | (א) עובד או עובד עצמאי שאינו תושב ישראל ישתלמו בעדו דמי ביטוח אימהות.

-- s 65(a)(1): "מבוטח לפי פרק י״א, למעט עקרת בית כהגדרתה בסעיף 238" (row IL-06 encodes it).
@ref NII s 335(b), line 3612; s 65(a)(1), line 802
GIVEN p IS A `A person in a contribution period, for section 335`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 335(b) — children contributions:` p MEANS
    p's `insured under Chapter 11` AND NOT p's `a housewife as defined in section 238`
-- src:3612 | (ב) מבוטח כהגדרתו בסעיף 65(א)(1) ישתלמו בעדו דמי ביטוח ילדים.
-- src:802 | (1) מבוטח לפי פרק י״א, למעט עקרת בית כהגדרתה בסעיף 238;

@ref NII s 335(c), line 3613
GIVEN p IS A `A person in a contribution period, for section 335`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 335(c) — work injury contributions:` p MEANS p's `insured under Chapter 5`
-- src:3613 | (ג) מבוטח לפי פרק ה׳ ישתלמו בעדו דמי ביטוח נפגעי עבודה.

@ref NII s 335(d), line 3614
GIVEN p IS A `A person in a contribution period, for section 335`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 335(d) — accident injury contributions:` p MEANS p's `insured under Chapter 6`
-- src:3614 | (ד) מבוטח לפי פרק ו׳ ישולמו בעדו דמי ביטוח נפגעי תאונות.

@ref NII s 335(e), line 3615
GIVEN p IS A `A person in a contribution period, for section 335`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 335(e) — unemployment contributions:` p MEANS
    p's `insured under paragraph (1) of the definition of insured in section 158` AND NOT p's `a controlling shareholder in a closely-held company`
-- src:3615 | (ה) מבוטח לפי פסקה (1) להגדרת [note: ”]מבוטח[note: “] שבסעיף 158 למעט בעל שליטה בחברת מעטים ישתלמו בעדו דמי ביטוח אבטלה.

@ref NII s 335(f), line 3616
GIVEN p IS A `A person in a contribution period, for section 335`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 335(f) — contributions for employees' rights in insolvency proceedings:` p MEANS
    p's `an employee insured under Chapter 8` AND NOT p's `a controlling shareholder in a closely-held company`
-- src:3616 | (ו) עובד המבוטח לפי פרק ח׳ למעט בעל שליטה בחברת מעטים ישתלמו בעדו דמי ביטוח זכויות עובדים בהליכי חדלות פירעון.

@ref NII s 335(g), line 3617
GIVEN p IS A `A person in a contribution period, for section 335`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 335(g) — disability contributions:` p MEANS p's `insured under Chapter 9`
-- src:3617 | (ז) מבוטח לפי פרק ט׳ ישתלמו בעדו דמי ביטוח נכות.

@ref NII s 335(h), line 3618
GIVEN p IS A `A person in a contribution period, for section 335`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 335(h) — long-term care contributions:` p MEANS p's `insured for long-term care`
-- src:3618 | (ח) מבוטח ביטוח סיעוד ישתלמו בעדו דמי ביטוח סיעוד.

@ref NII s 335(i), line 3619
GIVEN p IS A `A person in a contribution period, for section 335`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 335(i) — senior citizens and survivors contributions, and maternity contributions:` p MEANS
        p's `insured under Chapter 11`
    AND NOT p's `a housewife as defined in section 238`
    AND NOT p's `a widow pensioner as defined in section 238`
-- src:3619 | (ט) מבוטח לפי פרק י״א למעט עקרת בית ואלמנה בת קצבה כהגדרתן בסעיף 238 ישתלמו בעדו דמי ביטוח אזרחים ותיקים ושאירים ודמי ביטוח אימהות, בין שהוא מבוטח גם לפי פרק ג׳ ובין שאינו מבוטח לפיו.

-- src:3620 | (י) אין הוראות סעיף זה גורעות זו מזו.
@ref NII s 335(a)-(j), lines 3611-3620
GIVEN b IS A `A branch of insurance`
      p IS A `A person in a contribution period, for section 335`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 335 — contributions are payable in the branch` b `for` p MEANS
    CONSIDER b
    WHEN `maternity`                                    THEN `s 335(a) — maternity contributions, for a worker who is not an Israeli resident:` p
                                                          OR `s 335(i) — senior citizens and survivors contributions, and maternity contributions:` p
    WHEN `children`                                     THEN `s 335(b) — children contributions:` p
    WHEN `work injury`                                  THEN `s 335(c) — work injury contributions:` p
    WHEN `accident injury`                              THEN `s 335(d) — accident injury contributions:` p
    WHEN `unemployment`                                 THEN `s 335(e) — unemployment contributions:` p
    WHEN `employees' rights in insolvency proceedings`  THEN `s 335(f) — contributions for employees' rights in insolvency proceedings:` p
    WHEN `disability`                                   THEN `s 335(g) — disability contributions:` p
    WHEN `long-term care`                               THEN `s 335(h) — long-term care contributions:` p
    WHEN `senior citizens and survivors`                THEN `s 335(i) — senior citizens and survivors contributions, and maternity contributions:` p

@ref rows IL-04 and IL-05 answer contribution periods from January 2026 (their assumption A1)
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`this row answers section 335 for contribution periods from January 2026` MEANS
    REFUSE "this row answers section 335 for contribution periods from January 2026"

-- The nine branches in Schedule J's order (rows IL-04 and IL-05 list them the same way).
GIVETH A LIST OF `A branch of insurance`
`the branches of insurance, in the order of Schedule J` MEANS
    LIST `maternity`, `children`, `work injury`, `accident injury`, `unemployment`,
         `employees' rights in insolvency proceedings`, `disability`, `long-term care`, `senior citizens and survivors`

@export The branches of national insurance in which contributions are payable for a person under National Insurance Law s 335, from the statuses it turns on (resident, insured under Chapters 5, 6, 8, 9 and 11, under s 158(1), for long-term care, housewife or widow pensioner under s 238, controlling shareholder), for contribution periods from January 2026
@ref NII s 335, lines 3610-3620
GIVEN p IS A `A person in a contribution period, for section 335`
          @desc the person in the contribution period: the year, whether an employee or self-employed, an Israeli resident, and each insurance status s 335 reads
GIVETH A LIST OF `A branch of insurance`
`s 335 — the branches for which contributions are payable, for` p MEANS
    IF   p's `the calendar year of the period` LESS THAN 2026
    THEN `this row answers section 335 for contribution periods from January 2026`
    ELSE filter (GIVEN b YIELD `s 335 — contributions are payable in the branch` b `for` p) `the branches of insurance, in the order of Schedule J`
